  "description": "Word documents, Excel workbooks, PDF files and SSRS reports in .NET, in managed code — no Microsoft Office, no interop, no native binaries. This main package is the Word pipeline: it reads DOCX, legacy DOC, HTML, RTF, Markdown and text; renders to PDF (tagged, PDF/A-2b) and PNG/JPEG matching Word's own export; saves DOCX, HTML, Markdown, RTF, text, ODT, EPUB and RDL; edits documents (find/replace, placeholders, fields, tables, content controls, tracked changes); and rasterizes and assembles existing PDFs. Excel workbooks (DocWright.Spreadsheet), SSRS reports (DocWright.Reporting), mail merge, composition, comparison and signatures are companion packages.",
  "iconFile": "package-icon.png",
